<title>USA: CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 26.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 26.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT soybean delivery notices against August futures posted for August 27 (In thousand bushels).</p>
<p>SOYBEANS - 135. Up to August 19, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - continental grain/h 100, combs/h 35.</p>
<p>Received - s.a.k. &amp; co/c 85, edf man/h 40, kolton/h 5, rosenthal collins group/c 5.</p>
<p>H=house account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
